Scenario: In a Hospital patient management system, there is a requirement to delete a patient's record from the database upon their discharge. The following code segment is used to achieve this functionality:

```java
Preparedstatement stmt=con.preparestatement("delete from patients where patient_id=?");
stmt.setInt(1, 101);
int i=stmt.executeUpdate();
System.out.println(i + " patient record(s) deleted");
```

Enhanced question: In a Hospital patient management system, a code segment is provided to delete a patient's record from the database using a Preparedstatement in JDBC. Explain when this type of statement would be used in the context of managing patient data in a hospital setting.

