Scenario: In a Hospital patient management system, the database contains a table named 'patient_records' that stores information about patients admitted to the hospital. One common operation in this system is to mark a patient as discharged when they are released from the hospital. To achieve this, a JDBC code segment is written as follows:

Preparedstatement stmt=con.preparestatement("update patient_records set status='discharged' where patient_id=?");
stmt.setInt(1, 1234);
int i = stmt.executeUpdate();
System.out.println(i + " patient record updated to discharged status");

Identify the type of statement used in the given code segment and explain when this type of statement would be used in the context of a Hospital patient management system.

